{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-john-lewis-and-partners-2-seater-and-3-seater-slider-sofas-2511-0089","content_id":"d60cb823-b6b4-4559-a608-8f35056347a6","description":"Product Safety Report for John Lewis & Partners 2-Seater and 3-Seater Slider Sofas presenting a risk of fire. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"90567deb-75ae-4888-b18f-6927b893000e","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-03T15:55:42+00:00","id":"90567deb-75ae-4888-b18f-6927b893000e","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-03T15:55:42+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69305d7ecdec734f4dff41c6/2511-0089-product-safety-report-john-lewis-sofa__1_.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: John Lewis &amp; Partners 2-Seater and 3-Seater Slider Sofas</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as there is a faulty button on the recliner mechanism. This means there is a risk of the circuit board overheating and malfunctioning, causing the recliner to stop working.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: Only products with the product codes and sales period as listed below are subject to the modification programme, and affected consumers have been contacted by John Lewis.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Furniture – Household/Office Sofas (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>John Lewis &amp; Partners</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sizes</td>\n      <td>2-Seater, 3-Seater</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>Natural Chenille, Navy Chenille</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Codes</td>\n      <td>87023201, 87023202, 87021703, 87021702, 87021701, 87021704</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales Period</td>\n      <td>05/08/2025 - 30/10/2025</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>2- and 3-seater chenille slider sofas.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_90567deb-75ae-4888-b18f-6927b893000e\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69305d7ecdec734f4dff41c6/2511-0089-product-safety-report-john-lewis-sofa__1_.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire as there is a faulty button on the recliner mechanism. This means there is a risk of the circuit board overheating and malfunctioning, causing the recliner to stop working.</p>\n\n<p>This product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>Only products with the product codes and sales period as listed above are subject to the modification programme, and affected consumers have been contacted by John Lewis. They have advised that consumers unplug the product, stop using the recline/charging functions and contact the John Lewis &amp; Partners Aftersales Team to arrange a visit and repair via 03456 049 049.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0089</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-27T14:57:53Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["modification-programme"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-11-27","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-11-27T14:57:53+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-john-lewis-and-partners-2-seater-and-3-seater-slider-sofas-2511-0089","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-john-lewis-and-partners-2-seater-and-3-seater-slider-sofas-2511-0089","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-john-lewis-and-partners-2-seater-and-3-seater-slider-sofas-2511-0089","content_id":"d60cb823-b6b4-4559-a608-8f35056347a6","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-11-27T14:57:53Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: John Lewis & Partners 2-Seater and 3-Seater Slider Sofas (2511-0089)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-john-lewis-and-partners-2-seater-and-3-seater-slider-sofas-2511-0089","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type"